  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Health Check-up for 1,000 Vulnerable Children</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Majority of child deaths are due to disease conditions that could be easily prevented or treated given access to health care and improvements to their quality of life. Healthcare services for children in low resource settings can make a huge impact, providing them with the opportunity grow well and reach their full potential.  Your support for this project will help to reach 1,000 vulnerable children through medical outreach programs for health services and health education provision</narrative>
  </description>
